# ROE ticket flow

Agents follow this sequence for every new ROE ticket **without the user restating it**. Skip a step only if the user explicitly says so (e.g. “docs-only” or “hotfix”).

## Naming (required)

| Surface | Format |
|---------|--------|
| Issue / PR | `[ROE-NNN] Short title (ABC-NNN)` — omit `(ABC-NNN)` if no workstream alias |
| Commit | `[ROE-NNN][ABC-NNN] imperative message` — or `[ROE-NNN] message` if no alias |
| Branch | `feature/ROE-NNN-kebab-slug` from fresh `origin/develop` |

**ROE-NNN** is the global serial (never skip). Next free is tracked in `project.md` / `.lovable/plan.md` (**ROE-020** after ROE-019).

## Sequence

1. **Audit** — Read CONTEXT_PLAN (+ CURSOR.md if touching `src/` or `supabase/`). Search before inventing. For AI/scoring/pairings changes, also read `.cursor/rules/hallucination-guard.mdc`. Prefer a canvas for multi-finding audits.
2. **Impact analysis** — Write `docs/ROE-NNN-*-impact-analysis.md` (problem, acceptance, scope, files, test plan, deploy). Await user approval before coding unless they already said “implement”.
3. **Branch** — `git fetch origin develop && git checkout -b feature/ROE-NNN-… origin/develop`
4. **Implement** — Minimal diff; honor sync pairs; add/adjust Vitest for scoring/dietary/intent/pairings.
5. **Docs sync** — Same PR: `TODO.md`, `.lovable/plan.md`, `.cursor/CONTEXT_PLAN.md`, relevant CURSOR.md, next-free ROE bump. For ROE-016 staging work also sync `TODO_PROGRESS.md`, `docs/experimental/tickets/README.md`, impact docs.
6. **Ship** — Commit → push → `gh pr create` (title matches issue) → add to Rasaoi QA Board → set **In progress**.
7. **Ops / QA** — Note edge redeploy / `db push` in PR if needed. After merge, board → **QA**; stakeholder Pass → **Done**.

## Do not

- Commit secrets or `supabase/.temp/*`
- Skip impact analysis for non-trivial product changes
- Invent APIs/tables not in CONTEXT_PLAN without searching first
- Use `IP-FIX` / `FUL` / `ASK` as the sole ID — always assign **ROE-NNN** and append alias
